OL,3,GNEWSACornish art collection returns
OL,4,Ahome for exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaintings depicting life in Cornwall's
OL,7,Ffishing and rural communities more than
OL,8,Fa century ago have gone on display.
OL,10,FThe exhibition brings together 40 works
OL,11,Ffrom the acclaimed Bowerman Collection
OL,12,Fof Newlyn School art, a movement of
OL,13,Fartists who settled in west Cornwall in
OL,14,Fthe late 19th Century.
OL,16,FThe works have returned to Cornwall
OL,17,Fbefore embarking on a national tour and
OL,18,Fwill be displayed at the Penlee House
OL,19,FGallery and Museum in Penzance until
OL,20,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
